This product bundles a compiled ad, tracker and malware blocklist
(src-tauri/blocklist/rules.jsonl.br) generated from third-party filter lists
that are NOT covered by the Apache License. Those lists, their authors and
their licenses are recorded in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which is regenerated
together with the blocklist by `npm run blocklist`.
